# CloudKnowledge.Api — demo requests (SPEC §18). Start the API with `dotnet run --project src/CloudKnowledge.Api`.
# API reference in the browser (Development only): http://localhost:5210/scalar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5210

### Liveness — the process is running
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness — healthy once the index is built
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Rebuild the index (unchanged chunks come from the embedding cache)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/index

### Demo step 2 — expected at the top: deployment.md, container-apps.md
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search?q=How does the deployment process work?

### The 503 question — expected: troubleshooting.md, monitoring.md
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search?q=The application returns HTTP 503 after a deployment. What should I check?&top=5

### The upload question — expected: storage.md, security.md
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search?q=Where are uploads stored and how does the application authenticate there?
